<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">真实练习记录</view>
  <view class="title">练习记录</view>
  <view class="date note" wx:if="{{loaded}}">{{today}} · 日期以课堂服务器为准</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">暂时没有读到记录。{{error}}</view>
  <view class="loading-hint" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取记录…</view>
  <block wx:if="{{loaded && !error}}">
    <view class="summary card">
      <view class="number">{{todayWords.length}}<text> 个词</text></view>
      <view class="note">今天有练习记录的词</view>
      <view class="line note" wx:if="{{modeScene}}">当前保存安排：{{modeScene}}</view>
      <view class="line note">这些词的历史最高记录：曾独立说出 {{speakingCount}} 个 · 曾听懂 {{listeningCount}} 个 · 继续练习 {{practicingCount}} 个</view>
    </view>
    <view class="lesson-section">
      <view class="section-title">今日课堂（{{todayLessons.length}}）</view>
      <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!todayLessons.length}}">今天尚无课堂记录。词汇为空时也会单独显示课堂记录。</view>
      <view class="card lesson-card" wx:for="{{todayLessons}}" wx:key="session_id">
        <view class="word-top"><view class="mode-name">{{item.modeText}}{{item.scene_name ? ' · ' + item.scene_name : ''}}</view><view class="badge lesson-status-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</view></view>
        <view class="note">{{item.timeText}}{{item.elapsedText ? ' · ' + item.elapsedText : ''}} · 对话 {{item.dialog_count || 0}} 轮</view>
        <view class="note review-status">{{item.reviewStatusText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.reviewStatus === 'success' && item.reviewSegments.length}}" class="review-segments">
          <view wx:for="{{item.reviewSegments}}" wx:key="index" class="note">{{item.language}}：{{item.text}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.reviewStatus === 'failed'}}">点评未生成，课堂记录已保存{{item.review_error ? '：' + item.review_error : ''}}</view>
        <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.reviewStatus === 'not_applicable'}}">本模式无AI点评</view>
      </view>
      <view class="chip" bindtap="onToggleAllLessons">{{showAllLessons ? '收起' : '查看'}}历史课堂（{{allLessons.length}}）</view>
      <view class="card" wx:if="{{showAllLessons}}">
        <view class="picker-row" wx:for="{{allLessons}}" wx:key="session_id"><view>{{item.modeText}} · {{item.statusText}}</view><view class="note">{{item.timeText}}</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!todayWords.length}}">今天尚无词汇练习记录，这不等于没有上课。场景交流若未产生目标词记录，或只听「磨耳朵」，都可能没有新增词汇记录。口语练习后可刷新查看。</view>
    <view class="card word-card" wx:for="{{todayWords}}" wx:key="word_id">
      <view class="word-top"><view class="mode-name">{{item.word}}</view><view class="badge state-{{item.status}}">{{item.stateText}}</view></view>
      <view class="note">{{item.meaning}}</view>
      <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.unclear_count}}">{{item.unclearText}}。这不是答错次数。</view>
      <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.evidenceText}}">{{item.evidenceText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="note footnote">这里保留每个词曾达到的最高记录，不是今天的正确率，也不表示现在无需复习。次数是历次累计；系统没听清和成功跟读不会自动算独立表达，语音识别结果不是发音评分。</view>
    <view class="note footnote">复习时先不看答案试着说，再换个情境用一次。需要跟读也没关系，下次再试着独立表达。</view>
    <view class="chip" bindtap="onToggleAll" style="margin-top:16rpx;">{{showAll ? '收起' : '查看'}}全部已练记录（{{allWords.length}}）</view>
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{showAll}}">
      <view class="picker-row" wx:for="{{allWords}}" wx:key="word_id">
        <view>{{item.word}} · {{item.stateText}}</view>
        <view class="note">最近 {{item.last_practiced_date}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新记录</button>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="onToday">去「今日练习」改安排</button>
  <include src="../../utils/english-nav.wxml" />
</view>
